        <mxCell id="7pLNRe2Hsib97gX7ZQOw-60" value="&lt;h1&gt;UI Server (mobile)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The entry point between the private phone to the public server. It will display data as special lists and will be able to visualise them or will get visualise by internal service.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#36393d;fillColor=#ffcc99;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
