        <mxCell id="7pLNRe2Hsib97gX7ZQOw-100" value="&lt;h1&gt;Collections&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here you will see a bit of the project architecture, starting with the user web and mobile interface and ending up with databases using to store and search information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The target of the system is to visualise and simplify generic data starting with manual inserting of data and ending with classification of data according to type.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That wise mechanism will help collecting the stuff we love and sharing them with others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can use multiple templates of how to store and visualise the data. Every item stored in the list is built of key-value pairs which the key must be a unique string and the value can be any objects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Some object will be supported in a special mode, like links so you can built your Spotify playlist or your favourite websites. You also can store images and many others. All in one place, that&#39;s the magic behind &quot;Collections&quot;!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="29.999999999999996" width="776.34" height="229.12" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
