  <diagram id="sBfi4QqYITO8lAq-3AVM" name="Press Release">
    <mxGraphModel dx="880" dy="-574" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="0tQv1bZX6COY-aCz5ipq-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Aviv&#39;s products LTD introducing: COLLECTIONS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Our Press Release -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Aviv&#39;s products LTD has today (15/03/2023) announced about there new life changing product which meant to help thousands of people every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;A little about&amp;nbsp; the product, it&#39;s named collections after the main goal of the product, to collect. It&#39;s a generic way of collecting everything you like,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;from links to media and a lot more. For instance their product has an amazing two feature, auto classification and data aggregation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;You can put any data you&#39;d like and the auto classification will order it for you in lists while the data aggregator will apply built-in or custom function.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;which are being built by the user.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;So why is it useful? What are the use cases?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Our product allows built smart system for your custom use and help you visualise the data according to any of your needs. We help you share lists easily and reach to your audience in multiple platform. An example for that could be for musicians, when the singer or the bend are publishing a new album they can gain a lot of data and views from our product. How it&#39;s done? It&#39;s done by using our ability to collect, They will collect a list of their song and pair them with the links to the songs and then they are able to publish to you songs with any links for the platform the user likes the most, i.e. YouTube or Spotify.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;We know, it&#39;s a game changer. The options are infinite their is noting you can&#39;t do with our product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;But if there is some issues, please feel free to stay in touch with us :)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Our e-mail: aviv@products.ltd.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="49" y="1300" width="730" height="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
